  "details": "Some info about stuff like when has a world been visited and the\ntotal number of players over time and at each visit. Total time a world was actually running. Running time of the last instance and the longest open instance ever. I could go on with that but I guess you get the point.^^\nSimilar to the stats of a YT video or a game server. \n\nI could imagine that you do that already. If so maybe you could make some of the data public in the world-info in VRC or on the Website or even both. Would give the owner a bit more insight and it would make it possible to sort the maps by popularity or date or name. ;-)",
